Prove (the `proofload` package)
https://github.com/poisson-labs/prove
First party: Poisson Labs. Not yet public and not a declared dependency of this package
(see README, "Install"). Poisson Trace reads Prove's stored runs through Prove's public
API and copies none of its code; the estimators here are written independently and are
pinned equal to Prove's on shared inputs by the test suite.

