Test fixtures
tests/fixtures/ holds seven stored runs of Prove with their observation bodies removed:
three runs of the tau2-bench airline domain (tau2-bench, MIT,
https://github.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench) driven by gpt-4.1-mini, one of them the
patched guardrail pilot stored with no trace; two runs of the OpenAI Agents SDK
customer-service example (MIT, https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python); and two runs
of an agent on the HumanEval problems (HumanEval, MIT, https://github.com/openai/human-eval)
driven by gpt-4o-mini, reduced to their outcomes (task id, temperature, seed, outcome and
timing; no problem text and no completion). The envelopes carry span names, kinds, timings,
model ids and response ids, and no prompt or completion content.
tests/fixtures/PROVENANCE.md records each source and its digest.
